-- Awards and menu history for the World's 50 Best Bars 2025 (20260929100000)
-- and the seven-city bars (20260929400000), researched
-- on 29 Sep 2026 from the published lists and press; every row keeps the page
-- it came from.
--
--   awards: 1027 rows for 112 bars: The World's 50 Best Bars (1-100),
--     Asia's, North America's and Europe's 50 Best Bars (Europe's began in
--     2026) with their special awards, the Tales of the Cocktail Spirited
--     Awards, the James Beard Outstanding Bar award, the CLASS Bar Awards and
--     the Australian Bar Awards, through the 2026 editions already announced.
--     Places are positions, named awards are titles, by the year announced,
--     spelled the way 20260930100000 spells them (no sponsor, no "Award").
--     Awards to a person go on the person, as there, so none are here. Where
--     an earlier seed already has the same award, its row is kept. A bar's
--     earlier incarnation (old Kwant, Dandelyan, Three
--     Sheets Dalston) doesn't count toward the new one.
--   menus: 407 editions for 113 bars, with the month and year each
--     launched (month left out when only the year is known), a line on each in
--     our own words, and the drinks when a source lists them. Bars that only
--     rotate single drinks have their named or opening menus only. Five have
--     none on record: Bar Benfiddich and Attaboy make drinks to order, Gin
--     Palace keeps one standing list, and Tres Monos and Zest have no dated
--     menu online.
--
-- Rows join on the profile handle, so a database without these profiles
-- (local, tests) inserts nothing, and a rerun inserts nothing twice.

